@startuml
!include _style.puml
hide methods
hide circle
title F09 核心领域类图
class User {
  id: UUID
  username: str
  hashed_password: str
  role: UserRole
}
class Resume {
  id: UUID
  user_id: UUID
  file_path: str
  raw_text: Text
  parsed_data: JSON
  status: ResumeStatus
}
class Job {
  id: UUID
  user_id: UUID
  title: str
  raw_description: Text
  structured_data: JSON
  status: JobStatus
}
class MatchReport {
  id: UUID
  resume_id: UUID
  job_id: UUID
  overall_score: float?
  result_data: JSON?
  status: MatchStatus
}
class SavedJob {
  id: UUID
  user_id: UUID
  job_id: UUID
  stage: str
  notes: Text
}
class Education
class Skill
class Project
class WorkExperience
class Certificate
class JobRequirement
User "1" -- "0..*" Resume : 所有者
User "1" -- "0..*" Job : 发布者
User "1" -- "0..*" SavedJob : 私有求职记录
Resume "1" -- "0..*" Education
Resume "1" -- "0..*" Skill
Resume "1" -- "0..*" Project
Resume "1" -- "0..*" WorkExperience
Resume "1" -- "0..*" Certificate
Job "1" -- "0..*" JobRequirement
Resume "1" -- "0..*" MatchReport
Job "1" -- "0..*" MatchReport
Job "1" -- "0..*" SavedJob
note bottom of SavedJob
唯一约束：(user_id, job_id)。
报告通过 Resume.user_id 判断归属，
MatchReport 自身没有 user_id 字段。
end note
footer UML 类图 | 属性为关键字段子集，完整字段见数据库字典
@enduml
